# Seed content is checksum-pinned byte-for-byte: loading verifies the SHA-256
# of the exact bundled bytes (checksums.json + manifest sha256 pins). Disable
# ALL git line-ending conversion for the seeds tree so checkout bytes are
# identical on every platform — a Windows checkout must never rewrite LF to
# CRLF, or every seed integrity check fails. `-text` guarantees raw stored
# bytes both ways (no conversion on checkout, no normalization on commit) for
# every current and future carrier under the seeds directory.
data/methodology/seeds/** -text